{"id":"testament","lemma":"testament","pos":"noun","rank":2701,"glosses":["testament, last will","legacy"],"ipa":"/tɛs.ta.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9c/Fr-testament.ogg/Fr-testament.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"testaments"},"formAudio":{"testaments":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/91/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-testaments.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Il a rédigé un testament.","en":"He has drawn up a will.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to compose","l":"rédiger"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Il lui a tout laissé dans son testament.","en":"He left everything to her in his will.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"him, he, it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"all"},{"g":"to leave","l":"laisser"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"his, her, its"},null]},{"text":"Il a fait un testament l'année dernière.","en":"He made a will last year.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"year"},{"g":"last","l":"dernier"}]},{"text":"Il est mort sans avoir fait de testament.","en":"He died without having made a will.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"dead"},{"g":"without"},{"g":"to have"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Son père lui légua la maison dans son testament.","en":"His father left him the house in his will.","words":[{"g":"his, her, its"},{"g":"father"},{"g":"him, he, it"},null,{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"house, home"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"his, her, its"},null]}]}